        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mychal Thompson, Mike Dunleavy Jr.\n- Organizations: San Antonio Spurs, Golden State Warriors, University of Minnesota\n- Places: San Antonio, AT&T Center\n- Topics: NBA championships, player positions\n\nFacts:\n- Mychal Thompson played power forward and center for the University of Minnesota and for the NBA teams Portland Trail Blazers, San Antonio Spurs, and Los Angeles Lakers.\n- The San Antonio Spurs play their home games at the AT&T Center in San Antonio.\n- Golden State Warriors have won five NBA championships, which is tied for the fourth-most in NBA history with the San Antonio Spurs.\n- Golden State Warriors trail the Boston Celtics with 17 championships, the Los Angeles Lakers with 16, and the Chicago Bulls with 6.\n- Mike Dunleavy Jr. previously played for the Golden State Warriors, Indiana Pacers, Milwaukee Bucks, Chicago Bulls, and Cleveland Cavaliers.",
